stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft: 创建工作流
    
    Draft --> Submitted: 提交审批
    Draft --> Cancelled: 取消
    
    Submitted --> Approved: 审批通过
    Submitted --> Rejected: 审批拒绝
    Submitted --> Cancelled: 撤回
    
    Approved --> Completed: 流程完成
    Approved --> Suspended: 暂停执行
    
    Rejected --> Draft: 重新编辑
    Rejected --> Archived: 归档
    
    Suspended --> Approved: 恢复执行
    Suspended --> Terminated: 强制终止
    
    Completed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Terminated --> [*]
    Archived --> [*]
    
    note right of Draft
        草稿状态
        - 可编辑
        - 可删除
        - 未进入审批流
    end note
    
    note right of Submitted
        已提交状态
        - 不可编辑
        - 可撤回
        - 等待审批
    end note
    
    note right of Approved
        审批通过状态
        - 开始执行
        - 可暂停
        - 自动流转
    end note
    
    note right of Completed
        完成状态
        - 流程结束
        - 数据归档
        - 不可修改
    end note
